== 1. Lemma B2.1a brute force ==
   1600 (margins, c, gamma_max) instances with c >= max(1, mean(yf)_+): bound < 1 in 0
   minimum at the grid edge gamma = gamma_max whenever gamma_max >= max margin: 1119 of 1119
   gamma_max = 1e6: bound - 1 ranges 0.0181-0.2783; the k=0 confidence term ranges 0.0181-0.2783  (so the limit is 1 + conf, not 1)
   necessity: margins all 5, c ~ 2 (>= 1 but < mean margin): bound = 0.451 < 1

== 2. Lemma B1.4: C_t >= 1, monotone, <= C_inf ==
   beta=(0.9,0.999): min C_t 1.000000; nondecreasing: True; max C_t 7.2703 <= C_inf 7.2703: True
   beta=(0.9,0.99): min C_t 1.000000; nondecreasing: True; max C_t 2.3452 <= C_inf 2.3452: True
   beta=(0.5,0.9): min C_t 1.000000; nondecreasing: True; max C_t 1.8605 <= C_inf 1.8605: True
   beta=(0.0,0.999): min C_t 1.000000; nondecreasing: True; max C_t 31.6228 <= C_inf 31.6228: True
   beta=(0.95,0.9999): min C_t 1.000000; nondecreasing: True; max C_t 16.0199 <= C_inf 16.0202: True
   random growing sequences: max ratio / C_t = 1.0000 (<= 1)

