== 4. Theorem B2.4: cost of adding the zero function ==
   sqrt(a^2+b) <= a + min(sqrt b, b/2a) on 1e5 random pairs: True
   max over 300 random (n, rho, alpha) of extra / min(12 sqrt(ln2/n), 3 ln2/rho) = 0.9999 (<= 1)

