== 6. Constants ==
   lambda_sigma = 400.0 (set by group 3)
   t <= eps n c / (L0 lambda) = eps n / 200; steps per 1000 samples: eta=0.2 -> 25.0 eps, eta=0.02 -> 250.0 eps
   KL <= 0.1 n at n=16384: (a) t <= 8.19; (d2) t <= 2.048; (d1, delta'=0.01) t <= 0.0205
   Section 3, path: c >= 1 guaranteed for n <= (2 kappa phi)^2 = 4.38e+04; text uses (2 q kappa phi)^2 = 5.3e+04
   Section 3, Frobenius: c >= 1 guaranteed for n <= (2 kappa phi)^2 = 1.12e+05; text uses (2 q kappa phi)^2 = 1.36e+05

